  "steps": [
    "Add 1 tsp oil to a pan on medium heat, 1 large onion (~120g), thinly sliced, 1 tsp ginger garlic paste, Cook till golden brown.",
    "Add ¼ tsp turmeric, 1/2 tsp chilli powder, 1 tsp coriander powder, ½ tsp garam masala, Mix well and let it cook for a minute.",
    "Then add 120g tomato purée, 1/2 tsp salt, Mix well and cook for 2 min (it should become thick and glossy)",
    "Then add 250g chopped palak, Mix well on low flame and let it cook for 3 minutes.",
    "While the spinach is cooking, To a blender add 200g soft paneer, ⅓ cup hot water (for blending), Add this paneer purée into the spinach that’s cooking, Mix well and let it simmer for only a min or 2.",
    "Make a Tadka, 1 tbsp oil, ¾ tsp cumin seeds, 1 tsp Kashmiri chilli powder, 3 garlic cloves, finely chopped.",
    "Mix in the tadka and switch off the flame. Garnish with a handful of chopped coriander and enjoy."
  ],
